l repeat this 30 times and keep track of the total amount of time spent on sending all the messages and receiving all the acks. It computes the throughput by: 30 * message_size_in_bytes / total_time_in_seconds and print the throughput value. After that, the client should exit.","topics":[],"score":183125,"global_rank":407932},{"name":"maringantis/TCP-Socket-data-transfer-no-limit","owner":"maringantis","html_url":"https://github.com/maringantis/TCP-Socket-data-transfer-no-limit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"TCP socket program with no limit data transfer from client to server.No FILES operations were used.","topics":[],"score":183125,"global_rank":407933},{"name":"Kobeeeef/vision-docs","owner":"Kobeeeef","html_url":"https://github.com/Kobeeeef/vision-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":183122,"global_rank":407939},{"name":"HorusAlkebulan/mle-learning-go","owner":"HorusAlkebulan","html_url":"https://github.com/HorusAlkebulan/mle-learning-go","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Go-based ML Engineering","topics":[],"score":183122,"global_rank":407940},{"name":"RayVelez27/ansergy-diagram","owner":"RayVelez27","html_url":"https://github.com/RayVelez27/ansergy-diagram","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":183122,"global_rank":407941},{"name":"vetriliaa/MLHW3","owner":"vetriliaa","html_url":"https://github.com/vetriliaa/MLHW3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":183122,"global_rank":407942},{"name":"coopernurse/cmdlog","owner":"coopernurse","html_url":"https://github.com/coopernurse/cmdlog","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Wrapper for exec.Cmd that logs output to S3 / SMTP","topics":[],"score":183119,"global_rank":407952},{"name":"danrpts/mandelbro